{"completed": true, "response": "这一次，他先是舍不得已经得到的亲近，越觉得满足，就越不想让这一刻过去，心里也暂时沉浸在这种感觉里。这份留恋让他一时更想再靠近一点，但他又担心，表露心意会改变两人之间的亲近，所以刚升起的冲动很快又被压了下来。他虽然重新变得谨慎，心里却还是舍不得，既想让这一刻停留得更久，又有所顾虑，让原本安稳的感觉里多了一丝放不下、却又还没能释怀的牵绊。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e50282e5-b7c9-4b78-b6a7-aea546508d13", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004249297268Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:42:56.377798+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "21ae386ca86b5010968d4e1e313ec98fcae1d6739732340a4de0bec5a55646df", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004249297268Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-o